# Omniget
===
Local MCP server that lets Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and Gemini CLI use your own computer and your own logged-in accounts: chats, feeds, browser, files and downloads. Also a downloader for video, music and the courses you bought. Everything stays on your machine.
